      "description": "Inverse of for_property: links the Class Signal to the Class of SignalBinding Procedure that implements it. This can also link the Instance of a SignalBinding to the ControlSystem that implements it. This is the edge that connects the signal definitions to the facility-specific bindings in the graph.\n",
